  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Extracted `edge_is_wall` in `crates/sim/src/verify/section.rs` from `wall_gouge` to classify each region edge against `section`.\n- Updated `tangency` in `crates/sim/src/verify/section.rs` so `Mode::Boundary` with a model checks `cx.region` edges only when `edge_is_wall` returns true.\n- Kept unconditional checks on all `section` edges, on `Mode::Area` regions, and on no-model `Mode::Boundary` regions.\n- Added unit and integration pins in `crates/sim/src/verify/section.rs`, `crates/sim/tests/boundary_walls.rs`, and `crates/app/tests/face_rim_hole.rs`.\n- Recorded the design choice in `docs/decisions/2657-face-rim-hole-verify.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nA `Face` operation with `holes: lift` stops each clipped row piece a tool radius off the hole. When a hole sits near the open outer rim, that move end lands within one tool radius of the rim. `tangency` checked all `cx.region` loops against `chords` even when `Mode::Boundary` had a model and no material stood above the cut plane at that rim.\n\n## Tests\n\nPins:\n- `verify::section::tests::tangency_excuses_open_rim_with_model_and_convicts_wall_below_top` (red before fix, green after).\n- `boundary_walls::a_move_ending_near_an_open_outer_rim_with_a_model_is_clean` (red before fix, green after).\n- `boundary_walls::a_move_within_a_tool_radius_of_a_wall_below_the_model_top_is_a_gouge` (green before and after).\n- `face_rim_hole::face_lifting_over_a_hole_near_the_open_outer_rim_has_no_gouge_and_posts` (red before fix at moves 15, 18, 27, 30; green after fix with 5 plunges and clean post).\n- `face_rim_hole::face_cutting_within_tool_radius_of_a_wall_below_model_top_still_gouges_and_blocks_post` (green before and after).\n\nMutation results:\n- Restored `upstream/main:crates/sim/src/verify/section.rs`: `boundary_walls` and `face_rim_hole` failed; restored the fix and both passed.\n\nGates:\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 13 of 13 steps passed (`sim` lib and 4 suites, `app` 6 suites).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-sim -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed with no warnings.\n- Additional `camcraft-app` suites (`blind_floor`, `contour_outside_hole`, `face_holes`, `face_stock_edge`, `solid_law_goldens`, `verify`, `warned_moves`): all active tests passed (2 ignored heavy envelope tests in `verify`).\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe full `batch` tier, the `release` heavy lanes, and the `crates/ui` suites did not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone.\n\nEffort: high\nChangelog: Fix false gouge warnings when a Face operation lifts over a hole near an open outer rim.\nFixes #2657\n",
